          "chapter_id": "c-shiji-105-bianque",
          "source_id": "s-shiji-105-bianque",
          "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-105-bianque:p049",
          "quote": "上池祕術，長桑所傳。始候趙簡，知夢鈞天。言占虢嗣，屍蹶起焉。倉公贖罪，陽慶推賢。效驗多狀，式具於篇。",
          "mention_ids": [
            "c-shiji-105-bianque:m049-0012"
          ]
        }
      ],
